      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_OFFICER_POLICE_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_OFFICER_POLICE",
      "UnitMotion": "SMILE",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "흠흠, 안녕하세요! 오늘부터 여정을 시작하게 된 NOA 치안국 소속의 타운가드, 안나입니다.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "コホン、こんにちは！今日付けで旅に参加することになった、NOA治安局所属のタウンガードことアンナです！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 13,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_OFFICER_POLICE_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_OFFICER_POLICE",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "여정 단장님이시죠? 잘 부탁드립니다!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "あなたが旅の団長ですよね？よろしくお願いします！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 14,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_OFFICER_POLICE_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "JumpAnchorData": [
        {
          "Uid": 1,
          "JumpAnchorStringId_KOR": "응, 잘 부탁해.",
          "JumpAnchorStringId_JPN": "うん、よろしく。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Uid": 15,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_OFFICER_POLICE_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "JumpAnchorData": [
        {
          "Uid": 1,
          "JumpAnchorStringId_KOR": "그런데... 타운가드라고?",
          "JumpAnchorStringId_JPN": "ところで…タウンガードって？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Uid": 16,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_OFFICER_POLICE_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_OFFICER_POLICE",
      "UnitMotion": "NORMAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "앗, 네! 치안국은 이름대로 NOA의 치안을 유지하는 기관이예요.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "あっ、はい！治安局は、その名の通りNOAの治安を守る機関なんです。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 17,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_OFFICER_POLICE_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_OFFICER_POLICE",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "그리고 타운가드는- 이렇게-",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "そしてタウンガードは、こういう風にー",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 18,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_OFFICER_POLICE_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
